§ `Schedule 7 -- remainders, working holiday makers, non-residents, part-year residents`

-- Super remainder: OTI 71,500 -> 12,238 + 20,000 x 45% = 21,238. ETP remainder: 12,238 + 4,500 = 16,738.
-- WHM all on visa: 30,000 x 15% = 4,500. WHM 20,000 of 60,000: 3,000 + (8,788 - 288) = 11,500.
-- Non-residents: 9,000; 40,500 + 5,550 = 46,050; 40,500 + 20,350 + 4,500 = 65,350. Non-resident WHM: 6,750 + 1,500 = 8,250.
